OL,3,GNEWSAMajor fire breaks out at
OL,4,ANottingham city centre property
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major fire in Nottingham city centre
OL,7,Fhas closed multiple roads and stopped
OL,8,Ftram services.
OL,10,FAt 22:55 BST on Monday night,
OL,11,FNottinghamshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,12,Fsaid 12 fire engines were at the fire
OL,13,Fat a "residential property" in Market
OL,14,FStreet.
OL,16,FRoads are closed in Upper Parliament
OL,17,FStreet, Lower Parliament Street, Market
OL,18,FStreet, King Street and Queen Street,
OL,19,Fthe service added.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
