OL,3,GNEWSAMajor fire breaks out at
OL,4,ANottingham city centre property
OL,5,
OL,6,FNottingham Express Transit (NET) trams
OL,7,Fhave been stopped in both directions
OL,8,Fbetween the Theatre Royal and Market
OL,9,FSquare. The fire service has urged the
OL,10,Fpublic to avoid the area while
OL,11,Femergency services tackle the blaze.
